|--------|----------|--------|
| D3 JSON | `toD3(graph)` | `{ nodes: [...], links: [...] }` for D3.js force-directed graphs |
| GEXF | `toGEXF(graph)` | Gephi-compatible XML format |
| HTML | `toHTML(graph)` | Standalone HTML page with interactive force-directed visualization |

